[size=4][b][u]Component library and display filters[/u][/b][/size]

This page explains the reusable HUD pieces and display filters available to advanced players. Start with the player configuration guide for common changes.

[size=3][b][u]Reusable HUD sections[/u][/b][/size]
[list]
[*][font=Courier New]faction-display[/font] — selected theme crest.[/*]
[*][font=Courier New]contact-radar[/font] — passive 360-degree radar for contacts already delivered by Starfield.[/*]
[*][font=Courier New]quest-tracker[/font] — tracked objective.[/*]
[*][font=Courier New]environmental-hazard-scanner[/font] — planet, location, protection, and modeled exposure.[/*]
[*][font=Courier New]player-status-scanner[/font] — player statistics and meters.[/*]
[*][font=Courier New]equipment-rail[/font] — favorites, weapon, explosive, ammunition, and power information.[/*]
[*][font=Courier New]helmet-awareness[/font] — compass, threat state, status effects, and vehicle-exit control.[/*]
[*][font=Courier New]scanner-overlay[/font] — scanner-only forward contacts, up to five.[/*]
[/list]

[size=3][b][u]Display filters[/u][/b][/size]
[list]
[*][font=Courier New]visible[/font] always shows or hides a component.[/*]
[*][font=Courier New]visibleWhen[/font] supports [font=Courier New]always[/font], [font=Courier New]never[/font], [font=Courier New]inScanner[/font], [font=Courier New]inCombat[/font], [font=Courier New]weaponAiming[/font], [font=Courier New]firstPerson[/font], and [font=Courier New]hudVisible[/font].[/*]
[*]Combine states with [font=Courier New]AND[/font], [font=Courier New]OR[/font], [font=Courier New]NOT[/font], parentheses, and numeric comparisons.[/*]
[*]Unknown values stay hidden. Conditions allow 256 characters, 64 tokens, and 8 nesting levels.[/*]
[/list]

[size=3][b][u]Text placeholders and live values[/u][/b][/size]

Text can use a fixed value, one supported live source, or a bounded value template. Templates can use 1 through 8 variables. The fallback value is shown while live data is unavailable. Live source names ignore capitalization and underscores.

